# Build artifacts and dependency sources.
#
# The umbrella root leaves build_path/deps_path at their Mix defaults, so all of
# this is contained inside beam/ and the Python repository root is never touched.
# Leading-slash and bare forms are both listed so the tree is correct no matter
# which directory mix is invoked from.
_build/
/_build
deps/
/deps
doc/
/doc
cover/
/cover
/tmp
/tmp/

# NOTE: mix.lock is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the single resolved dependency
# set for all eight apps and has to be committed -- an uncommitted lockfile is an
# unreviewable dependency surface, which is exactly what this repository's
# dependency doctrine exists to prevent.

# Erlang/OTP build products
*.beam
*.plt
*.plt.hash
erl_crash.dump
*.dump
*.ez
*.tar

# Hex
.hex/
hex.lock.lock

# Dialyzer PLTs are large and machine-specific
/priv/plts
